  "details": "If you send a gallery image in an invite, and then take a photo for another invite later without clearing the previous gallery photo from the invite, the gallery photo will always be received by the user on the other end instead of the picture you took for every subsequent invite. This is despite the UI on your end displaying the picture you took.\nThe only way to fix this at the moment is to click the \"X\" at the top right corner and clear the image from your invite before taking a picture.",
